Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:03.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄影机开拍。录音就绪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cameras rolling. Sound speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开拍！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.77,0:00:06.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到《永恒之爱》！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to "Everlasting!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，废话不多说，有请你的追求者，亚当·克伦威尔！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, without further ado, your suitor, Adam Cromwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.31,0:00:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是克伦威尔酒店帝国的英国继承人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's the British heir to the Cromwell Hotel fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！天啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:16.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，来吧。大家动起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, come on. Let's go, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}裸露、报警、女人打架都有现金奖励。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get cash bonuses for nudity, 911 calls, cat fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟，她为什么哭？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aww, why is she crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:26.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我拍点有看头的画面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me some good TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, man! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}观众会恨死她的。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People are going to hate her. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好啊，帅哥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，我是费丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. I'm Faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:36.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停！卡！卡！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut! That's a cut! That's a cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这全是垃圾。我没法用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's garbage. I can't do anything with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:40.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去，马上搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, fix it, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:43.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋就是那个神秘自由职业者？惊喜吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel's the mystery freelancer? Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:46.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯子回来了。大家别一窝蜂冲过来抱我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy's back. Don't everybody rush to hug me at one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:48.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你运气好，你那点小把戏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're very lucky that your little stunt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:50.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上一季给我带来了爆棚收视率。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}got me boo-yah ratings last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你大可以让节目组撤诉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could just get the show to drop the charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:54.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得看到你从中吸取了教训。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to see that you have learned from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有意思，因为现在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's funny 'cause right now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这感觉有点像敲诈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it feels a little like blackmail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:00.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米，对不起，我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy, I'm sorry that I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.39,0:01:02.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起你一声不吭就消失了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That you disappeared without saying a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到你和莉琪复合了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Saw that you and Lizzie got back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:06.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是我未婚妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打过电话，瑞秋。是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I called, Rach. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.27,0:01:15.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果没念到你的名字，你的童话今晚就结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If your name is not called, your fairy tale ends tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:17.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要“输家镜头”对准牛仔竞技女王，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need loser cam on rodeo queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:20.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}九号机位给我转去拍邪恶的布兰妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I need camera nine to repo to evil Britney.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:21.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会赢下这季的，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna win this, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:23.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}费丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:25.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:27.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.39,0:01:30.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停！停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut! Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:33.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有反派，我做不了电视节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't make a television show without a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.18,0:01:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 已厌倦我的马达不停转动 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Been gettin' tired of my motor runnin' *
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.74,0:01:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 感觉过热，因为生活不断袭来 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Feelin' overheated 'cause my life keeps comin' *
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:55.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我的心被爱的速度困扰 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* My heart has been troubled by the speed of love *
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.45,0:01:58.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 在街头寻找灵魂同盟 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Searchin' the streets for a soul committee *
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:02:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 谈论欲望与怜悯的想法 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Talkin' ideas on lust and pity *
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我找到的寓言在家乡无处安放 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The fables I've found have no place at home *
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.49,0:02:08.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我需要你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Well, I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 想要我，拥抱我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* To want me, to hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 告诉我真相\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* To tell me the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.77,0:02:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 说，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Say I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:20.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早餐最后一次叫号。冷鸡蛋和火腿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last call for breakfast. Cold eggs and ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:22.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一次，两次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Going once, going twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.85,0:02:29.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:34.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，瑞秋？你到底在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Rachel? Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.49,0:02:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是瑞秋，请讲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go for Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:54.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，有人来找你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, there's somebody here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Flying in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:58.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才是不是叫我荡妇？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you just call me a slut?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下地狱吧，你这巫婆！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Burn in hell, you witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们所有人，都下地狱吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All of you, just burn in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.02,0:03:06.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布兰妮，布兰妮，布兰妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Britney, Britney, Britney.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.59,0:03:09.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完美的贱人，我们居然把她弄丢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perfect bitch and we somehow lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:12.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布兰妮在舞厅舞会上霸占着亚当，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Britney hogs Adam at the ballroom dance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布兰妮毁了佩珀和亚当的初吻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Britney ruins Pepper's first kiss with Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:21.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们整季都围绕她打造，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We built a whole damn season around her,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:23.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我需要一个新反派。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I-I need a new villain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有几个潜在人选。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a couple potentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:27.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。瑞秋在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's great. Where is Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:31.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝瑟妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bethany.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。怎么了？你怎么没在洛杉矶？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. What's up? Why aren't you in L.A.?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乐队在巡演。我猜你不再看推特了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Band's on tour. I guess you don't check Twitter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，没，没有。我只是有点……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, no. No, I don't. I've just been a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:41.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}躲起来了？我找到你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hiding? Well, I tracked you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不再忍受你的鬼话了，戈德堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not putting up with your crap anymore, Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你欠我三个月房租。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You owe me three months' back rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，当然。我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, totally. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃……我可以把钱给你，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I, uh... I can get it to you, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太晚了。我已经把你的房间租出去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too late. I rented out your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:52.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。不然呢？你一直音讯全无。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. What'd you expect? You've been M.I.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:56.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，不包括你的笔记本电脑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except for your laptop, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:02.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}24小时内付钱给我，否则这台MacBook就挂上Craigslist卖掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have 24 hours to pay me or the MacBook goes on Craigslist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。贝瑟妮，不行。不行，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Bethany, no. No, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说。你不能……你不能那么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen to me. You can't... You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:06.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那里面有很私人的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's, like, personal things on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:07.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，那里面有东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, there's things on there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会伤害到这里的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that could hurt people around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，好啊，这真是绝佳理由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, okay, well, great reason
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:13.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你振作起来把钱还我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to get your shit together and pay me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:26.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋。亚当要找他的制片人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rachel. Adam wants his producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:28.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在房间里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:30.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，太好了。你来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, good. You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:34.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我的剃须膏和PG Tips茶包用完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I'm out of shaving cream and PG Tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:37.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}英国茶。合同里写了的。好。行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}English tea. It's in my contract. Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:40.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，亚当，让我跟你解释一下，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Adam, let me just explain something to you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。制片助理就是跑腿的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. P.A.s fetch things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}制片人负责制作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Producers produce things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:46.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这到底什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意思是，我创造条件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It means that I create conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让事情有可能发生，然后我真的让它们发生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for things to happen and then I actually make them happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你是打扮成流浪汉的巫师，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you're a wizard dressed as a homeless person,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause let's be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:58.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就让助理去拿你的东西，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just get the P.A.s to fetch your stuff, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我需要你马上到楼下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I need you downstairs, like, A.S.A.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:03.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，等一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真……你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so... What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:07.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？这根本吓不到我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you know what? That doesn't even intimidate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道为什么吗？因为到处都是摄像机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know why? Because there's cameras everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:12.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}追求者的老二我见得够多了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen enough suitor dong
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}够我看一辈子了，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to last me, I would say, my entire life, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:23.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个淋浴看起来真不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That shower looks so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:31.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。别转身。别看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Do not turn around. Do not look.
