Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:36.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭上眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your eyes shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:39.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.01,0:05:41.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭上眼睛，不然我就……我一定能找到办法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your eyes shut, or I am... I will find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.01,0:05:43.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在全国电视上让你丢两次脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to double-humiliate you on national television.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:46.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我做得到，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you know I can, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:50.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是……这是……这是性方面的事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you... Is it... Is this a sex thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，你想得美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God, you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没见过像你这样的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have never met anyone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:06:02.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么，流浪汉巫师？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, a homeless wizard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:10.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，好。完了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, okay. Done?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And hurry it up.
