Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。谁能空运亚当的剃须膏过来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that. Can somebody fly in Adam's shaving cream
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确保他拿到他的，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and make sure that he's got his, uh,
