Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:06.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我很期待这些课程。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I'm looking forward to these lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我需要。我们能，呃……开始吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I need them. Can we, uh... we start?
