Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:29.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如直接找幼儿园老师佩珀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why don't you just go Pepper the kindergarten teacher?
