Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Game on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:10.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:12.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在去给我拍些“贱人”采访。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me some bitch interviews now.
