Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，她和其他几个女孩在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, her and some of the other girls were...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:53.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在说……说有点难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Were saying that... That it's kind of hard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想象你跟男人上床\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to imagine you in bed with a man
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:59.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为……因为你给人的感觉像个小女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because... because you come off like a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:01.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你有过这种感觉吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, do you ever get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:03.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我完全没这种感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I don't get that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从来没人提过你这种娃娃音吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one has ever brought up the baby-voice thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:08.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:10.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你昨晚见了一个男人。怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you met a guy last night. How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如你就全都告诉我吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you just tell me all about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，昨晚，亚当和我……嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, last night, Adam and I... Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.99,0:09:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}分享了一个美好又坦诚的时刻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shared a nice and honest moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦——得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:23.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，那……那绝对出乎意料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it was... It was definitely unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's good. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:27.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了，因为，你知道，有，呃……有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's great because, you know, there were, um... there were
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:30.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两个女孩，他说跟她们有火花，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}two girls that he said he felt a spark with, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:32.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:34.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，那你是不是很意外，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, so were you surprised,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，当事情……当气氛升温的时候？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, when things... When things heated up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不不不。我们没有身体接触什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, no, no. We didn't get physical or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:47.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那肯定是另一个女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It must have been the other girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，干得漂亮，戈尔迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, nice one, Goldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，什么，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, what, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:53.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是……是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who... Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能说。她……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't say. She...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，你知道，她有一种热带般的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, you know, she's got like a tropical...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:01.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像一阵热带微风拂过她的头发。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A tropical breeze blowing through her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝，那个……那个模特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace, the... the model?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么……怎么有机会跟他独处？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How... How did she get alone time with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这我就不知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:13.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。哇。格蕾丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. Wow. Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她，呃……她动作很快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's, uh... She's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是忍不住一直想，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just can't stop thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:19.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的，我通过律师资格考试就为了干这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like, really, I passed the bar for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不错。不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not bad. That's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:24.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好，瑞秋。我们可以用这段剪出点东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's good, Rachel. We can cut something together out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:29.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想这么说，但你可能该回去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hate to say this, but you should probably get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们一直在找你。哦，该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've been asking for you. Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:38.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老婆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老公。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这里干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想我了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:45.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直想。我打过电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Always. I called.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:47.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我的手机，呃，没电了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my phone, uh, is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:50.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只需要你签这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just need you to sign these.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:52.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好吧，你说了算。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well, you're the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:04.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，呃……贝瑟妮来过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, um... Bethany came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:10.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么，你那个情绪化室友？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, your emo roommate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？嗯，我以前那个情绪化室友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why? Mm, my forme emo roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:14.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。是啊，她把我的房间转租出去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. Yeah, she rented out my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:15.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她把我所有东西都送来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She dropped off all my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，除了我的电脑，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, except for my computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:21.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她把它扣着当人质，直到我把欠她的房租付清。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which she's holding hostage until I pay her back rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.05,0:11:22.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不需要它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:24.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不知道里面有什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have no idea what's on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}辛西娅！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cynthia!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:33.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，呃，是来参加灰姑娘舞会的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you, uh, come up for the Cinderella ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:34.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.43,0:11:36.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是来找切特签一些文件，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just came to get Chet to sign some paperwork,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一些新的家族信托之类的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}some new family trust or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:43.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你看起来还和以前一样美得惊人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you look incredible as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:45.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你简直在发光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you're actually glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你……你是在做飞梭激光还是练瑜伽，还是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you... Are you doing Fraxel or yoga, or what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.51,0:11:51.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怀孕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:55.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:57.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是这么说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:00.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:03.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。这，呃……我是说，惊喜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. That's, um... I mean, surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:06.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，确实是惊喜。真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, surprise, indeed. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:10.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安静，排练开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quiet. Rehearsal's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:13.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，那个其实……是我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, oh, that's actually... That's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好了，我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Okay, I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，见到你真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. It was so great seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:17.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You too. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:21.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，听我说，我就跟你们直说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, listen. I'm just gonna level with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩有谁见过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have either of you ever seen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黑人女孩在这种节目里夺冠吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a black girl win one of these shows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人进过四强吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Has one even made it into the final four?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}13季里只有两次，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Twice in 13 seasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她们只有一种办法能走到那一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but there's only one way they make it that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:36.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别说我猜你要说的那种话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't say what I think you're about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，相信我，我这黑人的灵魂也疼，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey, believe me, it pains my black soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你应该知道真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you deserve the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥玛罗莎、妮妮·利克斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Omarosa. NeNe Leakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:48.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得豁出去，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got to go big, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大声、有主见，意见特别多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Loud and highly opinionated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:53.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去斯佩尔曼学院读书、给最高法院大法官当书记员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't go to Spelman and clerk for a Supreme Court Justice
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可不是为了在电视上当个粗俗的骚货。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to end up some ratchet hoochie on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:57.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我配得上留在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I deserve to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:13:00.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我想凭我自己进四强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I want to be in the final four because of who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死，我就是想让人们记住我的名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, I just want people to know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:05.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样等我开美发店的时候，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So when I open my hair shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:07.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门口能排起长队。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there will be a line around the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就叫雅典娜。保持格调。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Athena it is. Stay classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:13.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，请跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, come with me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们还有得忙呢，姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have got some work to do, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，“猎婊”行动进展如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. How did the bitch hunt go, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.03,0:13:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅典娜愿意配合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Athena's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:20.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。戈尔迪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. Goldy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:22.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟安娜那边好像有点进展。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looked like you were getting someplace with Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:24.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我觉得会很难。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I think it's gonna be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，她聪明又戒备心强，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, she's smart and guarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以……总之……也许吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so, uh, in short... Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒是摸进佩珀的心里了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I got in Pepper's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她会给我们点东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she'll give us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:33.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, uh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:35.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}制作办公室刚接到安娜·马丁姑妈的电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The production office just got a call from Anna Martin's aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她父亲在重症监护室，心脏病发作了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her father's in the I.C.U. He had a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:41.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来你的“也许”没了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, there goes your maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:44.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，你们看过她的资料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on. You guys, you've read her file.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她爸心脏本来就不好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her dad has a crap heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会没事的。你看看她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll be fine. And look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就让她开心玩玩吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just let her have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可那是重症监护室啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, but it's the I.C.U.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:58.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得告诉她吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna say something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。她会情绪失控想走的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. She'll get all emotional and want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:01.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们都这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.21,0:14:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以这事就把良心放门外吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I say leave your conscience at the door on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:05.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你说得对，我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Yeah, you're right. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我明早第一件事就告诉安娜她爸的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I will tell Anna about her dad first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不关我事。是，可你脸上写着呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of my business. Yeah, but you have that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个表情？对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This look? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不，你看，这个表情是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no. No, see, this look is,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:35.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“求你了老天，别让瑞秋再崩溃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Please, God, don't let Rachel freak out again
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:37.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把节目也搞垮，因为我还要这份工作。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and bring the show down with her 'cause I need my job."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了，拜托。你跟我一样讨厌这工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, come on. You hate this job as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿啊，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you are, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我正找你呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:48.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}午饭时间到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's lunch time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我收拾点东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Just got to pack up some stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走咯，小狗狗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get along, little doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.09,0:14:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饿死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:56.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不知道你们怎么受得了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know how you guys do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我，呃，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I, um, I ju...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:01.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莉齐，我就是想跟你道歉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lizzie, I just wanted to apologize,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是，那段录像什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, about that footage and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:05.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不用解释。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. There's no need to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早就知道你们俩的事了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew about you guys already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰里米也告诉我那是个多大的错误\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Jeremy told me what a huge mistake it was
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对你们俩都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:14.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:19.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说你经历了很多，还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said that you'd been through a lot and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我只想让你知道，如果你需要什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I just want you to know that if you need anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:25.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}任何事都行，我们俩都在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like anything at all, we're both here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:42.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是个宝宝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it's a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:48.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是不打算告诉我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Were you not going to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:50.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打算说的。事情不是你想的那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was. It's not what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:52.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是吗？因为看起来就像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No? Because it seems like
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的刑期又加了18年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just got 18 years added to my sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}辛西娅老了，也干枯了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cynthia is old, and she's dried up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:00.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们没想那么多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we weren't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她只比我大两岁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is two years older than me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你说你早就不做爱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you said that you never had sex anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几乎不做了。我甚至不知道孩子是不是我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hardly ever. I don't even know that it's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:12.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许根本保不住呢。现在还早。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe it won't even stick. It's very early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我就该干等着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I'm supposed to hang around
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:18.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盼着你老婆是荡妇，或者盼她流产？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and hope that your wife is a slut or that she miscarries?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:19.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:23.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我受够了当侧室了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I-I-I am done being the side-wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.22,0:16:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会再等你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I am not waiting for you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:29.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的，去你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw this and screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:40.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟他跳过一次舞，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I danced with him once,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我们连话都没说上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we haven't even gotten to talk. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你就让那个给他口活儿的女孩赢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what, you're just gonna let the girl who went down on him win?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她真那么干了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:49.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说，就这一次，我想看个配得上的人赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, for once, I would like to see somebody deserving win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你干嘛不上？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:16:59.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她挤开啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, push her out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玩这场游戏。去玩啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Play the game. Play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.26,0:17:04.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:05.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:07.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:13.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-镜头对准安娜。  -收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Cameras on Anna.   -Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下，格蕾丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, Grace.
