Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:21.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下，亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. One second, Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.24,0:17:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.61,0:17:25.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是有个……关于你的传闻，你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, there's just this... This rumor that you, um...
