Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:45.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Um, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:55.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才那算是搞砸了。怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So that was kind of a fail. What happened? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发现我差点就要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I realized I was about
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在全国电视上荡妇羞辱一个女人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to slut-shame a woman on national television,
