Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你大概不会信，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you're probably not gonna believe this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm not, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:14.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，我得跟你说两句，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here. I need to talk to you for one second, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸爸今早心脏出了点状况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your dad had a heart thing this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:22.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在重症监护室。他没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's in the I.C.U. He's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你弟弟陪着他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your brother's with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，什么叫心脏出了状况？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. Whoa. Wh-what do you mean, a heart thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:30.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得回家。我弟弟才16岁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to go home. My brother is 16 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，我只是需要你留下来参加淘汰仪式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I-I just need you to stay for the elimination ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:38.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}淘汰仪式？我爸可能快死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The elimination ceremony? My dad could be dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只求你再待几个小时，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just asking about a few more hours here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以让他第一个选你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I-I can have him pick you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:44.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can have, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以让车停在外面等你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can get a car waiting for you right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托了。我今天本来都不该告诉你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, please. I wasn't even supposed to tell you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:54.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你合同里有这一条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there is this clause in your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:59.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.21,0:19:00.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你能不能给我弟弟发个短信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But will you please text my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他我要回去了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and let him know that I'm coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:04.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，太好了，好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Great. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上给我找奎因来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody get me Quinn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因的门锁着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn's door is locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:14.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管她有多忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. I really don't care th-that she's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.39,0:19:15.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敲门就是了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just knock on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:17.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:20.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:27.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:37.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜翻墙跑了。有人跑了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna's gone over the wall. We've got a runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:52.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为奎因会让你不带摄像机去救安娜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you think Quinn's letting you rescue Anna without a camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰，我要这些女孩个个眼冒星星、容光焕发。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, I need these girls all moony-eyed and glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:04.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要满屏的公主梦幻镜头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need princess-fantasy footage out the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.65,0:20:18.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当和玛丽在跳舞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam's with Mary dancing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伴着五百万个遥控器按键的节拍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to the beat of 5 million remotes clicking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:23.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切换去看更辣、更潮、更湿的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to someone hotter, hipper, and wetter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赶紧做点什么。搞大它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just do something. Blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:28.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜还没消息。暂时没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No word about Anna. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:34.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到她往哪跑了吗？没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see where she went? Mnh-mnh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:36.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但跑的人总是往大路去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But runners always head to the main road.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好啊……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩珀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:44.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩珀。嗨，你好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pepper. Hi. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些人在说些话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, some people have been saying some things
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:48.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可能也听到了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you may have heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:52.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说我……我表现得不像个成年人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that... that I... I don't act like a grown-up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说我没，那个，经验。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that I'm not, you know, experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，绝对没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:21:01.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我眼里你就是个可爱的成年女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, y-you seem like a lovely adult woman to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是，我想向你证明。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am, and I want to prove that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你今晚淘汰丽塔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to cut Rita tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:20.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说她一直在黑我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heard she's been slamming me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.48,0:21:21.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会让你白干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll make it worth your while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丽塔是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's Rita?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:28.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.93,0:21:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就在附近哪儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:39.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}9点。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}9:00. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根本不擅长这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not good at that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，我能把他借走一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry. Can I steal this one from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，抱歉。当然。不不不，他要的是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, sorry. Sure. No, no, no. He wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨！最近怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi! How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.61,0:21:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:56.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挺好的？嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Going good? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:57.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:21:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.95,0:22:00.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这样。看看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.69,0:22:02.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.92,0:22:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}B机和C机，看你们的了。收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"B" and "C" cam, do your thing. Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.16,0:22:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好戏开场。看我家的狠角色碾压全场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go. Watch my bitch dominate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.63,0:22:10.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哎哟！哎哟！  -哦，抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ow! Ow!   -Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:11.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.56,0:22:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她踩到我的脚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She stepped on my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.03,0:22:14.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，哦，真对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走路得看着点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to watch where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.97,0:22:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我以为我一直在看呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.47,0:22:20.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过你知道，我笨手笨脚的，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, you know, I got two left feet, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这话什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，这个……我也不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, well, it's... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.78,0:22:28.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明显比我跳得好，所以……为什么这么说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're obviously a better dancer than me, so... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:30.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为只有黑人才有节奏感？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because only black people have rhythm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.65,0:22:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，完全不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:34.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没那么说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:37.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我老家那边都是跳乡村舞、开土风派对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where I come from it's all about hoedowns and hootenannies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:40.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，而在小镇另一头，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, and on the other side of town,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就在扭臀热舞、狂嗨，还吃西瓜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we be twerkin' and crunkin' and eating watermelon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我没那么说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I did not say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.60,0:22:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我高中有半数的同学是黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Half the kids in my high school were black.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:49.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有很多黑人朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had a lot of black friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别说“我最好的朋友里也有黑人”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not say, "Some of my best friends were black."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.94,0:22:53.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道那是种族主义者才会说的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that's what racists say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.97,0:22:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是种族主义者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am not a racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.81,0:22:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也是他们常说的另一句话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's the other thing they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:23:00.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来这里不是为了受气的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did not come here to be disrespected!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.18,0:23:01.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别。嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:02.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们，呃，我们……好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's, uh, Let's... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们，呃……去那边给你拿杯喝的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's, um... Let's get you a drink over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.62,0:23:08.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么都没做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得漂亮，汤姆叔叔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice work, Uncle Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她肯定在里面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's got to be inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}*仰头灌下老酒，直到喝光*\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Tippin' back the old bottle till it's gone *
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.18,0:23:36.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。你还要打给谁吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks. You need to call anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.72,0:23:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}*用家酿烈酒淹没你的痛苦*\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Drown your pain in homemade sauce *
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.59,0:23:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}*唱着悲伤的歌，直到天亮*\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Sing your sad, sad songs until the dawn *
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，听着。呃……我知道你很难过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look. Um... I know you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.74,0:23:59.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我向你保证……我会帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I promise you... I'm gonna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.61,0:24:02.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？我会送你回家见你爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? I'm gonna get you home to see your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.54,0:24:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没能跟他道别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}道别？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.52,0:24:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.17,0:24:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜，拜托，你能不能，呃……让我进去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna, please, can you just, uh... Can you just let me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:34.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开。别烦我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go away. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.01,0:24:36.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是……你不能待在这里，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just... You just can't stay here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我带你回去，这样我们就能……去你的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me take you back so we can... Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.94,0:24:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.15,0:24:45.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着。我真的、真的很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look. I am so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.05,0:24:48.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至无法想象你现在有多痛苦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't even imagine what you're going through right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:54.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……我很担心你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm just... I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.80,0:24:59.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了，你的鞋怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, what happened to your shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.26,0:25:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去死吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.98,0:25:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.35,0:25:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.15,0:25:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会让你回去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm gonna make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.36,0:25:25.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拿命保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.90,0:25:40.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，佩珀，今晚发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Pepper, what happened tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.14,0:25:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当吻我的时候，我的心都漏跳了一拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My heart skipped a beat when Adam kissed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.61,0:25:46.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在，呃，真的有种真正的联系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We, um, have a real connection now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.78,0:25:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你不如告诉我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, why don't you tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.98,0:25:53.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得今晚早些时候发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what you think happened earlier tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.22,0:25:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，这个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.29,0:25:59.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.39,0:26:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的有很多黑人朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really do have a lot of black friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.26,0:26:04.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非洲……黑人朋友。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}African... black friends. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.13,0:26:06.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非裔美国朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}African-American friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.13,0:26:10.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我是基督徒，所以我不……我不恨任何人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm a Christian, so I don't... I don't hate anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走。对，我们拍到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go. Yeah, we got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.11,0:26:23.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么样？呃，不太好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is she? Uh, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.75,0:26:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她伤得很重，整个人都垮了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's hurt pretty bad, all torn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.25,0:26:27.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。给我八分钟，我就准备好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice. Give me eight minutes. I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.39,0:26:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.96,0:26:33.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来是《永恒》，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coming up on "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.96,0:26:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当与他完美的女人建立了特别的联系，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam makes a special connection with his perfect woman
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.83,0:26:39.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却发现……打给消防队。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}only to discover... Call the fire department.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.16,0:26:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他们有个女孩晕倒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell them one of the girls collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.37,0:26:42.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要救护车，马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need an ambulance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.07,0:26:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，好吧，但上次他们说不要再报假警了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, okay, but last time, they said no more false alarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.17,0:26:46.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不是我的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.34,0:26:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我不想……我不想见任何人，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I don't want to... I don't want to see anyone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.11,0:26:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不用见。你不用见，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to. You don't have to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.14,0:26:53.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结束了。都结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's over. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.18,0:26:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在让亚当和所有女孩到车道上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want Adam and all the girls in the driveway now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.75,0:26:56.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.98,0:26:59.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，走，走，走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.82,0:27:03.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点。走，走，走！加快速度！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Let's go, let's go, let's go! Pick up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.12,0:27:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家做最后调整！裙子拉低，胸露出来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody, finishing touches! Dresses down, boobs out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.76,0:27:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}半圆站好。快点，快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Semicircle. Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.46,0:27:10.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点，快点，快点，快点，快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.76,0:27:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要苦脸，明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need sad faces, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:14.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就当你的小狗死了，你的隆胸假体感染了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your puppy died, your implants got infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:17.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管。就用这表情。苦脸。快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care. Just use it. Sad faces. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.30,0:27:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有人，马上调到七频道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody, on channel seven now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.14,0:27:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要手机。能借你的用一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a phone. Could I use your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.41,0:27:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得给我哥打个电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to call my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.28,0:27:27.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会不知道该怎么办的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not gonna know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.41,0:27:28.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了。你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crap. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.78,0:27:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃……我把手机落在房子里了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, uh... I left my phone back at the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.22,0:27:33.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先……先处理一下你的伤口吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let... Let's get your cuts taken care of
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.22,0:27:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后给你找部手机，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we will get you a phone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.76,0:27:43.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这都是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.16,0:27:45.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.16,0:27:47.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不在乎我能不能回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't care about me getting home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.40,0:27:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.34,0:27:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把那玩意儿从我脸前拿开。别来烦我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get that out of my face. Just leave me the hell alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.77,0:27:53.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜。安娜，安娜，我们只是需要……安娜……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna. Anna, Anna, we just need... Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.50,0:27:54.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你需要？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.84,0:27:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我不管你需要什么，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I don't care what you need, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.91,0:27:58.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么事都骗我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You lied to me about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.48,0:28:03.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只在乎这个恶心又吸人灵魂的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All you care about is this hideous, soul-sucking show.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.48,0:28:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.15,0:28:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都该下地狱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You all deserve to burn in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.23,0:28:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.36,0:28:20.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}离我远点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.53,0:28:23.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米，停下。说真的。把摄像机放下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy, stop. Seriously. Camera down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.97,0:28:24.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米，停下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.94,0:28:33.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我陪你吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want me to come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.38,0:28:35.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，我自己来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.32,0:28:41.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把那些脚印拍下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get those footprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.80,0:28:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.27,0:29:00.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说服老板同意用私人飞机了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so, I got my boss to agree to the private jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.21,0:29:01.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚就能送你回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can get you home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.97,0:29:04.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。谢谢。顺便说一句，我不干了。安娜，安娜，你看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great. Thanks. I quit, by the way. Anna, Anna, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.81,0:29:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.14,0:29:08.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，如果你不让我讲出你的完整故事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, if you don't let me tell your whole story,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.08,0:29:10.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……我没法保证节目会讲成什么故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just... I can't guarantee what story the show will tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.38,0:29:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我他妈才不在乎。天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I give a damn. God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.32,0:29:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会告你违约……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're gonna sue you for breach of...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.59,0:29:16.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就告我啊，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So sue me then, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.09,0:29:19.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去告一个爸爸刚死的女孩吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sue the girl whose dad just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我还以为你是个真正的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I thought that you were an actual person.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.00,0:29:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。四台摄像机。我需要素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Four cameras. I need footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.44,0:29:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼泪、情绪，然后我们可以大做悲剧文章。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tears, emotions, and we can milk the tragedy angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.50,0:29:34.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，不行，不行。她说过葬礼上不许拍摄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. She said no cameras at the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.44,0:29:36.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我明白她很难过，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I get that she's upset, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.44,0:29:39.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是律师。如果我们做得太过，她就走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a lawyer. If we overplay this, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.14,0:29:40.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我需要亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I need Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.88,0:29:43.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。安娜，她想退出。她不再信任我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Anna, she wants to quit. She doesn't trust me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.48,0:29:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得只有他能把她劝回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think that he's the only one who can get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.12,0:29:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好极了。所以，屋里没有男嘉宾，也不能拍摄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great. So, no suitor in the house and no cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.06,0:29:52.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得真漂亮，戈德堡。你真是超常发挥了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stellar work, Goldberg. You've really outdone yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.57,0:30:03.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸生病的时候，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When my dad got sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他来和我和我哥一起住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he came to stay with me and my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.50,0:30:08.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，那真是……你就是管不住自己，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, honestly, it was... You can't help yourself, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.57,0:30:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是很难熬。你现在是手痒着想拍这个吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just hard. You're physically itching to film this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.61,0:30:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我走之前，就……就几天，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But before I left, just... just for a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.28,0:30:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他重新想起了这些回忆，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he got back all of these memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.65,0:30:22.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大多是关于特里和我小时候的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}mostly of Terry and me when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.19,0:30:24.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，他曾是我的英雄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, he was my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:28.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，呃，切特想让你去前面见他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, Chet wants to see you out front?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.66,0:30:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟他说我很忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell him I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.30,0:30:38.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.37,0:30:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……我真觉得我不该那么跟他说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just... I really don't think I should tell him that
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.51,0:30:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我真的很喜欢在这里工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I really like working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.61,0:30:47.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧。出去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.29,0:30:56.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。省省吧，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Save it, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.02,0:30:58.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我要说的都说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I said everything I'm gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.69,0:31:00.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。但我有东西给你。过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. But I have something for you. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.39,0:31:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。绝对不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.99,0:31:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你别想靠送东西把这事糊弄过去，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are not going to gift your way out of this, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.66,0:31:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是末日，老兄。这是世界末日。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the apocalypse, man. This is end of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.27,0:31:09.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。你知道，这个孩子对我来说也是个陷阱，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. You know, the baby's a trap for me, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.00,0:31:12.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你永远不会离开她，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are never going to leave her,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.54,0:31:14.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨天已经把这点表现得很清楚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and yesterday made that very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.54,0:31:17.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我为什么这么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then why did I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.44,0:31:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是为我们建的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm building it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.28,0:31:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穆赫兰道山顶，视野绝佳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Top of Mullholland with a view.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.02,0:31:27.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男女主人各自的书房，各自的淋浴间，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His-and-her offices, his-and-her shower,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.09,0:31:29.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我们说过的，各自的主卧……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}his-and-her bedroom like we talked about...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.06,0:31:30.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保持神秘感嘛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep the mystery alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.66,0:31:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.96,0:31:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}九月就能完工。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be ready in September.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.46,0:31:34.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你猜怎么着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.96,0:31:37.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}归你了。没有任何附加条件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's yours. Free and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.96,0:31:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，让我一个人住？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, to live in alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.63,0:31:41.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要装个暴雨式淋浴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna put in a deluge shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.50,0:31:48.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想要暴雨式淋浴，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want a deluge shower, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.07,0:31:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.08,0:31:52.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的悼词很动人。真……真的很打动人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your eulogy was so lovely. It... it really struck a chord.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.51,0:31:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.15,0:32:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着……呃，我知道你现在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen... uh, I know what a difficult time
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.29,0:32:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正经历多么艰难的时期。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're going through right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.75,0:32:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，但有时候转移一下注意力会有帮助，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, but sometimes it can help to take your mind of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.39,0:32:07.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很乐意帮你做到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I would love to help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.73,0:32:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有英国人的作风。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How very British of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.43,0:32:13.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就别想它了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.26,0:32:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，行，酷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, yeah, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.53,0:32:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.07,0:32:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我想帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I would like to help with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.67,0:32:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.54,0:32:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能。抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.48,0:32:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我得照顾我弟弟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I have to take care of my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.01,0:32:28.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他现在只有我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm all he has now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.55,0:32:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.22,0:32:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我理解。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.69,0:32:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.59,0:32:42.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。不好意思。什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. Excuse me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:44.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不会丢下她弟弟的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not gonna leave her brother
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.36,0:32:46.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为她其实是个好人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause she's actually a decent person.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了。去他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? Screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.63,0:32:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系。这锅我背。太可怕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fine. I'll take the heat. It's horrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.24,0:32:55.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。慢着。也许还有别的办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. Hang on. There might be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.08,0:33:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，特里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, uh, Terry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.41,0:33:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特里，对吧？你是安娜的弟弟？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Terry, right? You're Anna's brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.82,0:33:05.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，你好。我……我是瑞秋。这位是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, hi. I-I'm Rachel. And this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.48,0:33:07.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是那个节目里的家伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the guy from the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.52,0:33:08.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。亚当·克伦威尔。没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Adam Cromwell. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.82,0:33:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲的事，我很遗憾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry about your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.36,0:33:12.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，这时机真是够可以的，对吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, some timing, huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.52,0:33:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，呃……我真的很喜欢你姐姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, um... I really like your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.63,0:33:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她是个非常迷人的女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she's a fascinating person.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.10,0:33:18.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真心被她吸引了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm genuinely intrigued...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.46,0:33:20.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别见怪，但你这套鬼话我一个字都不信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No offense, but I don't buy any of this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.73,0:33:24.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，特里，是这么回事，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, uh, Terry, here's the deal, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.40,0:33:27.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当超有钱，而且他超喜欢你姐姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, Adam's super rich, and he's super into your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.67,0:33:29.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来根本不该跟你说这些，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, and I'm not even supposed to be telling you this,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.84,0:33:32.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你姐姐真的有机会赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but your sister has a real shot at winning this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.21,0:33:37.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说二十万美元，要是他最后娶了她，可能还更多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm talking $200,000, maybe more if he ends up marrying her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.18,0:33:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你考虑一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give it a think.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.62,0:33:41.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，搞什么？哦，嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell, Rachel? Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.59,0:33:43.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是想让我回节目吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is she trying to get me back on the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.82,0:33:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是。是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.19,0:33:48.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.39,0:33:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当真的很喜欢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam really likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.30,0:33:52.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这种地方你找不到那样的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You won't find a guy like that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.40,0:33:54.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你上节目就是为了这个，记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why you came on the show, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.87,0:33:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在为什么放弃？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why bail now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.44,0:33:58.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where would you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.17,0:34:01.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去露丝姑妈家住。就六周。我会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll stay with Aunt Ruth. It's six weeks. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.37,0:34:03.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经结束了。爸爸走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's over. Dad's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.44,0:34:06.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走吧。真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.54,0:34:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话还真没法反驳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kind of hard to argue with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.66,0:34:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我回去吧，安娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come back with me, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.30,0:34:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.43,0:34:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.20,0:34:30.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.50,0:34:32.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.34,0:34:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这怎么也得值一台 Xbox 吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's got to be worth an XBox.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.61,0:34:42.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下，特里。稍等一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One sec, Terry. Hold on one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.65,0:34:44.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.55,0:34:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}24 小时到了。我的钱呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}24 hours is up. Where's my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.82,0:34:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，别急。我在弄。我……我正想办法给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, no. I'm getting it. I'm... I'm in the midst of getting it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.69,0:34:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是手头这事儿有点复杂，跟……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just kind of in this complicated work with...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.49,0:34:53.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.93,0:34:56.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我还会上你几次当，瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How many times do you think I'll fall for your crap, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道。我还指望再有一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. I'm hoping once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.50,0:34:59.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.83,0:35:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行？行吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No? No. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.70,0:35:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说的那些私事还真不是开玩笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You weren't kidding about all that personal stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.57,0:35:09.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我读了你写给杰瑞米、没发出去的那封肉麻情书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I read your unsent sappy love e-mail to Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.94,0:35:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是求婚信还是软色情小说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it a marriage proposal or soft-core
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.61,0:35:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都分不清了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause I can't even tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.18,0:35:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对他女朋友莉齐可不怎么客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not very nice about his girlfriend Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.42,0:35:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝瑟妮，住手。住手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bethany, stop. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.35,0:35:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我还找到了你们节目组的人员名单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I also found the crew list to your show.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.93,0:35:29.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}3900 美元，瑞秋，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}$3,900, Rach,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.46,0:35:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然我就把你吐的那些心声发给所有人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or your heart barf goes live to all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.50,0:35:34.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，贝瑟妮，住手。听我说，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Bethany, stop. Listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.33,0:35:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米现在跟莉齐订婚了。他很幸福。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy is engaged to Lizzie now. He's very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.54,0:35:38.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经搞砸过他的人生一次了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've already messed up his life once.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.37,0:35:39.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再来一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would prefer not to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.91,0:35:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解决办法很简单……晚上十点前付钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy solution... Pay me by 10:00 P.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.38,0:35:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把 PayPal 链接发给你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I sent you a PayPal link.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.52,0:35:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家好。很高兴回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, everybody. It's great to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.79,0:36:00.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那天晚上，在安娜的悲剧之前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The other night before Anna's tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.29,0:36:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很享受更了解你们大家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really enjoyed getting to know more of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.46,0:36:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都很可爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're all so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.43,0:36:06.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现在我得做一些艰难的决定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But now I have some hard decisions to make
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.73,0:36:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于该跟谁更进一步了解。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as to whom I should get to know even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.00,0:36:15.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.24,0:36:18.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意继续陪我走这段旅程吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you continue this journey with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.94,0:36:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:24.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。他还真把那个伐木工留下了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, wow. He's really keeping the lumberjack.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.25,0:36:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜他想要个哥们儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess he wants a buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.52,0:36:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.66,0:36:31.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.72,0:36:33.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意继续陪我走这段旅程吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you continue this journey with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:35.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无聊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.46,0:36:39.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉。只剩三个位置了，亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. There is only room for three more, Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.66,0:36:41.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没被选中的五个女孩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The five girls that are not chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.93,0:36:43.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会有车等着你们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the cars will be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.64,0:36:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅典娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Athena.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.74,0:36:50.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意继续陪我走这段旅程吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you continue this journey with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.81,0:36:51.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hells yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.98,0:36:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有意思。干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Interesting. Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.55,0:36:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.75,0:36:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Pepper，你愿意继续和我走这段旅程吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pepper, will you continue this journey with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.85,0:37:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。干得好。干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Good work. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.69,0:37:08.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想把最后一个邀请\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I would like to extend this last invitation
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.63,0:37:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}送给这周真正偷走我心的一个特别女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to a very special girl who truly stole my heart this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.80,0:37:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Anna。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.94,0:37:23.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再那样折磨我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't torture me like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.98,0:37:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的很抱歉。是他们逼我这么做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm really sorry. They made me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.34,0:37:28.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.82,0:37:34.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很高兴你在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm really glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.45,0:37:36.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.82,0:37:40.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，我们现在需要你去控制室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, we need you in the control room right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.96,0:37:42.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，Rach。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.33,0:37:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.33,0:37:44.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？呃，把Anna找回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Um, getting Anna back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.63,0:37:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，Lizzie在跟她谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Lizzie's talking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.06,0:37:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来这其实可能对她挺好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It sounds like this might actually be really good for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.37,0:37:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.47,0:37:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好。  -那么，晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay.   -Well, have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.34,0:37:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.01,0:38:03.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Jeremy，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.05,0:38:05.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.42,0:38:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.96,0:38:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.63,0:38:18.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've... I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.13,0:38:24.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有很多黑人朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a lot of black friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.14,0:38:25.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是种族主义者才会说的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what racists say.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.70,0:38:29.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}铁杆黑人婊子，Jay。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rock-solid black bitch, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.54,0:38:31.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice job. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.78,0:38:34.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Shia，你发现了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shia, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.04,0:38:36.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}认识一下Pepper。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Meet Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.45,0:38:38.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们全都是那么甜的小可爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're all such sweetie pies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.95,0:38:41.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一大群人真好玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So fun to have a big group.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.12,0:38:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就好像Pepper有分裂人格似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like Pepper has split personalities or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.16,0:38:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她给我们看的一面跟给Adam看的一面完全不一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She shows us a very different side than she shows Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.59,0:38:51.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你今晚把Rita剪掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to cut Rita tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.00,0:38:54.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会让你白干的。我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll make it worth your while. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.47,0:38:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，她，呃，确实挺怪的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, she's, um, definitely weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:00.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但可能行得通。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.14,0:39:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我们没法让Athena留那么久，所以就Pepper吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we can't really keep Athena around that long, so Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.61,0:39:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊！什么？看来我们有新反派了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! What? Looks like we have a new villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.08,0:39:07.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.68,0:39:11.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，终于。你发现了什么，Rach？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, finally. What do you got, Rach?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.65,0:39:15.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说你在剪辑室待了大半夜。交出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard you were in the edit bay half the night. Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.75,0:39:17.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，这太荒唐了。我是你老板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, this is ridiculous. I'm your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.92,0:39:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在你背后的是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is right behind your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.82,0:39:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢。我就从你这儿拿走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you very much. I will take that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.83,0:39:26.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。开始吧，派对达人们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Here we go, party people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.96,0:39:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家准备好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.74,0:39:33.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.10,0:39:35.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来在《Everlasting》中，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coming up on "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.84,0:39:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Adam和他完美的女人建立了特别的联系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam makes a special connection with his perfect woman
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.45,0:39:42.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却发现她有阴暗的一面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}only to discover she has a dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.88,0:39:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.75,0:39:48.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把那东西从我面前拿走。别他妈烦我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get that out of my face. Just leave me the hell alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.45,0:39:49.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.82,0:39:51.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她和Adam有过很甜蜜的时刻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She had a really sweet moment with Adam
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.72,0:39:52.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后就跑了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.89,0:39:55.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许她有亲密关系障碍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe she has intimacy issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.13,0:39:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你需要？我才不管你需要什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you need? I don't care what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.93,0:40:00.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么事都对我撒谎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You lied to me about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.06,0:40:03.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当她的情绪变得危险时，她会攻击谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who will she attack when her emotions become dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.50,0:40:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都该下地狱被烧死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You all deserve to burn in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.07,0:40:08.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下周《Everlasting》揭晓。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Find out next week on "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.64,0:40:11.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有什么毛病？这太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your problem? It's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.14,0:40:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把死亡去掉，然后……瞧……精神病反派。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take out the death and... Voilà... psychopath villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.85,0:40:19.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.08,0:40:21.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.12,0:40:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别全花在妓女和可卡因上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't spend it all on hookers and blow.
